[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19380.708, "timestamp": "05:23:00", "text": "好的，新增内容。我的天哪，亚历克斯，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19383.27, "timestamp": "05:23:03", "text": "拿到了字符串大师。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19389.59, "timestamp": "05:23:09", "text": "好的。干得好，巴卡。我正在攒钱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19392.35, "timestamp": "05:23:12", "text": "樟宜机场和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19394.628, "timestamp": "05:23:14", "text": "嗯，还有即将到来的那一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19396.23, "timestamp": "05:23:16", "text": "然后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19399.51, "timestamp": "05:23:19", "text": "什么是长号的ping？呃，等等，呃，让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19401.47, "timestamp": "05:23:21", "text": "我把它链接进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19404.868, "timestamp": "05:23:24", "text": "描述，这样你们就可以查看了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19405.628, "timestamp": "05:23:25", "text": "它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19409.75, "timestamp": "05:23:29", "text": "出去。呃，稍等一下，给我一分钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19411.788, "timestamp": "05:23:31", "text": "忘了做这件事。呃，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19413.47, "timestamp": "05:23:33", "text": "坏的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19417.51, "timestamp": "05:23:37", "text": "所以，如果你查看“关于”中的描述，就会发现这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19419.83, "timestamp": "05:23:39", "text": "等等，让我来做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19422.788, "timestamp": "05:23:42", "text": "所以，粉色特朗普长号……呃，它不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19426.31, "timestamp": "05:23:46", "text": "游戏。它更像是一个应用程序或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19431.55, "timestamp": "05:23:51", "text": "就像GitHub上的东西，你在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19435.83, "timestamp": "05:23:55", "text": "能听出你的声音不是你的声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19437.59, "timestamp": "05:23:57", "text": "就像正常人的声音一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19439.39, "timestamp": "05:23:59", "text": "调制和"}]